# Testing Standards

## Go
- Use the standard testing package.
- Use table-driven tests when appropriate.
- Test handlers and application services.
- Test authorization boundaries.
- Test database operations.

## Python
- Use pytest.
- Test scanner integrations independently.
- Mock external processes.
- Test malformed results and timeouts.
- Test scope enforcement.

## Frontend
- Use Vitest.
- Use React Testing Library.
- Test important user workflows.
- Test error and loading states.

## Quality Requirements

- Every critical business rule requires tests.
- Every security boundary requires tests.
- Do not ignore failing tests.
- Do not remove tests to make builds pass.
- Report untested functionality honestly.
- Run relevant tests before considering a task complete.